#: Youtube_settings.py:415
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"Option 1 (automatic): Use the 'Export YouTube Cookies (Anti-Block)' button below. Close your browser first, then press it and pick your browser from the list.\n"
"\n"
"Option 2 (manual):\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr "Cara mendapatkan kuku YouTube:\\n\\nOpsi 1 (otomatis): Gunakan tombol 'Ekspor Kuki YouTube (Anti-Blokir)' di bawah ini. Tutup browser Anda terlebih dahulu, lalu tekan tombol tersebut dan pilih browser Anda dari daftar.\\n\\nOpsi 2 (manual):\\n1. Pasang ekstensi 'Get cookies.txt' di Chrome atau Firefox\\n2. Masuk ke YouTube di browser Anda\\n3. Klik ikon ekstensi dan ekspor kuki\\n4. Simpan sebagai cookies.txt dan pilih di sini\\n\\nMenggunakan kuki membantu menghindari blokir karena YouTube melihat Anda sebagai pengguna yang sudah masuk."

